  TJJM gym-website overrides, file 6. Same format as files 1-5: ~Name|URL~
  An EMPTY value blanks the link. Only add an entry that CHANGES something.
  Rendered last, after file 5, by BOTH sections. Gate C3 forbids a name in two files.

  16 Aug 2026 - BATCH 38. 25 links restored, moved here out of tjjm-gym-websites-3.liquid,
  which had no headroom left.

  TWO SOURCES, both from auditing our own work rather than the web's:

  1. RECOVERIES (batch 36). 240 records we had blanked were researched to find where the school
     lives now; 46 were found, a 19% hit rate. Every URL was opened and its city or street
     address matched to the record before it was accepted.

  2. FALSE-POSITIVE RESTORATIONS (batch 38). 212 removals that had never been re-tested - the
     parked, hijacked and wrong-business verdicts - were re-resolved on BOTH host forms and
     RE-READ IN A REAL BROWSER rather than the fetcher. 16 of the 212 were live schools we had
     wrongly un-linked, a 7.5% error rate. Across the whole audit programme 37 of 343 removals
     tested have turned out to be wrong - 10.8%.

  WHY THE RE-READ USED A BROWSER: the fetch tool serves STALE CACHED page bodies. It has returned
  live-looking school content for domains a browser showed were dead, and spam for a domain a
  browser showed was a placeholder. Any verdict resting on a fetched body is weaker than it
  looks. Detail in CRITICAL-false-positive-removals.md.

  Notable: Miller's Martial Arts Academy and Cascade Jiu-Jitsu were removed as HIJACK for carrying
  injected pharma spam. Both are the schools' own live sites and the spam is gone. Odyssey MMA was
  removed as wrong-location; the record and the site both say South Amboy NJ.
{%- endcomment -%}
