  16 Aug 2026 - BATCH 46. Identity pass, groups 11-12, plus the FOURTH browser re-check of
  rows a fetch pass had flagged.

  18 removals: 6 AGGREGATOR, 3 DEAD, 3 PARKED, 3 WRONG_CITY, 2 HIJACK, 1 STRIKING_ONLY.

  EVERY DEAD, PARKED, HIJACK, WRONG_CITY AND STRIKING_ONLY VERDICT HERE WAS CONFIRMED BY
  LOADING THE PAGE IN A REAL CHROME BROWSER, NOT BY THE FETCH TOOL.

  THE ONE TO REMEMBER - Kaiten Mixed Martial Arts Academy. This is the NINTH injected-spam
  case and the most important one we have found. Its page reads 100% CLEAN in innerText:
  a body-text screen, ours or anyone's, sees a normal martial arts school and passes it.
  The spam is a position:absolute; visibility:hidden block of POLISH CASINO LINKS, and the
  pages it links are hosted ON THE SCHOOL'S OWN DOMAIN. It was found ONLY by scanning raw
  outerHTML and computed styles. A body-text screen CANNOT SEE THIS CLASS OF COMPROMISE.
  FUTURE SCREENS MUST CHECK HIDDEN ELEMENTS - outerHTML plus computed style - not innerText.

  Impact Martial Arts Harrison redirects to HARUM77, an Indonesian slot gambling site.

  The three WRONG_CITY are MATERIALLY DISTANT, not adjacent suburbs:
    Peak Performance MMA   record Yonkers NY,             site serves Keller TEXAS
    NovaGym                record Montreal,               site Quebec City, ~250 km
    Peak Performance       record North Richland Hills TX, site Cedar Park, ~200 mi

  NOTE: Peak Performance and Peak Performance MMA are TWO DIFFERENT RECORDS. They were
  matched on the exact full name; a prefix match would blank the wrong one.

